  "answer": "Yes, this is a real bug. Root cause: sim/simulator.go:647 unconditionally increments TotalOutputTokens on every decode step, but sim/batch_formation.go:232 resets ProgressIndex to 0 on preemption, causing the request to re-execute all decode steps and double-count output tokens. Fix: added OutputTokensCounted field to Request (survives preemption) and gated TotalOutputTokens++ on decode progress exceeding the high-water mark. After fix, small KV (265 preemptions) and large KV (0 preemptions) both report total_output_tokens=105082 for the same workload.",
